# ── NDA HYGIENE (ABSOLUTE) ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Commercial 180nm NDA PDK content is NEVER committed.
# input/ holds the staged commercial PDK (symlinks to out-of-repo scratch)
# plus the non-NDA spec docs + design RTL copy. Exclude the whole tree.
input/
# Any stray staged PDK / bridge / deck copies anywhere in the run
**/pdk/liberty/
**/pdk/lef/
**/pdk/gds/
**/pdk/calibre/
**/pdk/spice/
**/pdk/bridge/
**/pdk_stage/
# heavy binaries that need per-file NDA review before any commit
*.gds
*.lef
*.lib
*.cdl
*.spice
*.sp
*.oas
*.gds.gz
# netlists that may embed foundry cell names / device params
**/stage*/**/*.v
**/stage*/**/*.def
**/stage*/**/*.spef
